a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Now Sapphire review:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/5487-now-sapphire-riviera-cancun\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/5487-now-sapphire-riviera-cancun\/<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.239.253.193","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80227,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea2fc8e871dc510101795c8b709853f4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"vancouverpetunia\" post=\"1915262\" timestamp=\"1470854532\"]\n@[member=\"Johnsonspartyof2\"] We rented the sound system and some decor from [url=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor\/\"]Love &amp;amp; Lace Wedding Decor[\/url]. Unfortunately I don&#039;t think she is renting to Now Sapphire brides any longer. But worth asking and maybe things will change by 2018.[\/quote]\n@[member=\"vancouverpetunia\"] Okay thank you ill give it a try.","Attachments":[],"Id":1915263,"PostDate":1470842519,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                   