Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.232.223.153","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80075,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f8b5ff0d7baebaaded33f63e2321f604","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I just ordered a frame on etsy for our sand ceremony. I&#039;m just wondering where everyone got their sand for the sand ceremony. The frame doesn&#039;t come with sand. I know you can buy some on etsy, but I&#039;m wondering if anyone has any recommendations. I think I would prefer to be able to go to a store to pick the sand out so I can see the colors in person. Any suggestions???&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913345,"PostDate":1462445864,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just ordered a frame on etsy for our sand ceremony. I'm just wondering where everyone got their sand for the sand ceremony. The frame doesn't come with sand. I know you can buy some on etsy, but I'm wondering if anyone has any recommendations. I think I would prefer to be able to go to a store to pick the sand out so I can see the colors in person. Any suggestions???<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mldiehl1215@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.6.210.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460223892,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MeredithLynne","Id":286686,"Name":"MeredithLynne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.106.64.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80075,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"604727dfe5e72dd785ceaccd2cef9c17","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MeredithLynne\"] &amp;nbsp;Hi! Congrats on your upcoming wedding!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There are a few places that you can get the sand. Davids Bridal sells it online and they have a huge range of colours to choose from. I&#039;m not sure if you&#039;re in the US or canada, but Hobby Lobby also sells it online and again, has quite a big selection of colours. If you&#039;re in canada, there is a company called Weddingstar that sells online. I know there are a couple of other places - just do a google search for wedding sand and I think the listings will come up.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;When I got married 4 and a half years ago, I got the sand at Davids and used a beige colour with pink. When we renewed our vows last October, I bought at Hobby Lobby and used turquoise and a bright pink.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913368,"PostDate":1462541459,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286686\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286686-meredithlynne\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MeredithLynne<\/span><\/a> \u00a0Hi! Congrats on your upcoming wedding!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There are a few places that you can get the sand. Davids Bridal sells it online and they have a huge range of colours to choose from. I'm not sure if you're in the US or canada, but Hobby Lobby also sells it online and again, has quite a big selection of colours. If you're in canada, there is a company called Weddingstar that sells online. I know there are a couple of other places - just do a google search for wedding sand and I think the listings will come up.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>When I got married 4 and a half years ago, I got the sand at Davids and used a beige colour with pink. When we renewed our vows last October, I bought at Hobby Lobby and used turquoise and a bright pink.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80075,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"809a583d4ddc80ee0688ea8b2553d887","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You can choose a destination wedding. Generally wedding planners do not provide these if it is not a theme party.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If u have already told your&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;#&#039;&gt;Event Management Company&lt;\/a&gt; about theme then they will arrange this.&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/destinationweddingdetails.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/beach-theme-wedding-centerpieces-002.jpg\" alt=\"beach-theme-wedding-centerpieces-002.jpg\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.beautiful-beach-weddings.com\/images\/candle.jpg\" alt=\"candle.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913465,"PostDate":1462849156,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You can choose a destination wedding. Generally wedding planners do not provide these if it is not a theme party.<\/p>\n<p>If u have already told your\u00a0<a href='#' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Event Management Company<\/a> about theme then they will arrange this.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/destinationweddingdetails.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/beach-theme-wedding-centerpieces-002.jpg\" alt=\"beach-theme-wedding-centerpieces-002.jpg\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.beautiful-beach-weddings.com\/images\/candle.jpg\" alt=\"candle.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katherineriverace@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425086317,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282278.png?_r=1425103909","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":242,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RitvikSehgal","Id":282278,"Name":"RitvikSehgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80075,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2220e9ceb6486ba46c22b8b1bcd946f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;In online e-commerce site various types of sand for decorations is available.&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img.alibaba.com\/wsphoto\/v0\/464019470_1\/hot-selling-colored-sand-for-art-painting-wedding-decoration.jpg\" alt=\"hot-selling-colored-sand-for-art-paintin\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/236x\/78\/27\/2d\/78272d5f80f5cabafc7319ea3c2f7dec.jpg\" alt=\"78272d5f80f5cabafc7319ea3c2f7dec.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913476,"PostDate":1462853003,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>In online e-commerce site various types of sand for decorations is available.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img.alibaba.com\/wsphoto\/v0\/464019470_1\/hot-selling-colored-sand-for-art-painting-wedding-decoration.jpg\" alt=\"hot-selling-colored-sand-for-art-paintin\"><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/236x\/78\/27\/2d\/78272d5f80f5cabafc7319ea3c2f7dec.jpg\" alt=\"78272d5f80f5cabafc7319ea3c2f7dec.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bharatkirayabhandar.com\/'>http:\/\/www.bharatkirayabhandar.com\/<\/a>","Email":"arijitjindal@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1454482596,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286120.jpg?_r=1454497509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"arjit","Id":286120,"Name":"arjit","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.158.49.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80075,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4942b3a96330cc01cbfbad4716018d4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Look for sand ceremony suppliers, they can offer huge selection of sparkling sand&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914674,"PostDate":1467695034,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Look for sand ceremony suppliers, they can offer huge selection of sparkling sand<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\">Event planner and curator at <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.poptop.uk.com'>http:\/\/www.poptop.uk.com<\/a>\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size:14.6667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;\"><strong>Poptop <\/strong>event marketplace <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span><\/span>","Email":"svitlanapoptop@gmail.com","IpAddress":"95.158.49.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1467098318,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SvitlanaG","Id":287249,"Name":"SvitlanaG","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
